---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
---

<Figure caption="KDA 的任务管线：Coder 迭代候选 kernel，验证矩阵收集证据，KernelWiki 与 ncu-report 提供可检索的经验。">
	<div class="ka-diagram ka-kda">
		<svg
			viewBox="0 0 960 690"
			role="img"
			aria-labelledby="ka-kda-title ka-kda-desc"
			xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
		>
			<title id="ka-kda-title">KDA 工作流</title>
			<desc id="ka-kda-desc">
				任务经过 draft、plan、候选 kernel 与编译、正确性、benchmark、ncu 验证，最后记录保留或放弃的理由；KernelWiki 与 ncu-report 作为可检索知识从侧面供给计划与验证。
			</desc>

			<defs>
				<pattern id="ka-kda-grid" width="28" height="28" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
					<path d="M28 0H0V28" fill="none" stroke="var(--ka-dg-grid)" stroke-width="1"></path>
				</pattern>
				<marker
					id="ka-kda-arrow"
					viewBox="0 0 8 8"
					refX="6.6"
					refY="4"
					markerWidth="7"
					markerHeight="7"
					orient="auto-start-reverse"
				>
					<path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8Z" fill="var(--ka-dg-line-strong)"></path>
				</marker>
				<marker
					id="ka-kda-arrow-teal"
					viewBox="0 0 8 8"
					refX="6.6"
					refY="4"
					markerWidth="7"
					markerHeight="7"
					orient="auto-start-reverse"
				>
					<path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8Z" fill="var(--ka-dg-teal)"></path>
				</marker>
				<marker
					id="ka-kda-arrow-amber"
					viewBox="0 0 8 8"
					refX="6.6"
					refY="4"
					markerWidth="7"
					markerHeight="7"
					orient="auto-start-reverse"
				>
					<path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8Z" fill="var(--ka-dg-amber)"></path>
				</marker>
			</defs>

			<rect width="960" height="690" fill="url(#ka-kda-grid)" opacity="0.55"></rect>

			<text x="28" y="34" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="12.5">
				KDA · 从任务定义到可复核的记录
			</text>
			<text x="932" y="34" text-anchor="end" class="dg-mono dg-teal" font-size="12.5">
				CODER × VERIFIER
			</text>

			<!-- 主轨 -->
			<g aria-hidden="true">
				<path d="M48 96V544" fill="none" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line-strong)" stroke-width="1"></path>
				<path d="M61 96H84M61 176H84M61 256H84M61 336H84M61 440H84M61 544H84" fill="none" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)" stroke-width="1"></path>
			</g>

			<!-- 01 任务定义 -->
			<g>
				<rect x="88" y="64" width="500" height="64" rx="12" class="dg-surface dg-line"></rect>
				<circle cx="48" cy="96" r="13" fill="var(--ka-dg-bg)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line-strong)" stroke-width="1"></circle>
				<text x="48" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11">01</text>
				<text x="108" y="88" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11.5">DEFINE / 任务定义</text>
				<text x="108" y="113" class="dg-title dg-text" font-size="20">任务定义</text>
				<text x="572" y="113" text-anchor="end" class="dg-muted" font-size="14.5">正确性、性能用哪条命令测，通过条件是什么</text>
			</g>

			<!-- 02 draft -->
			<g>
				<rect x="88" y="144" width="500" height="64" rx="12" class="dg-surface dg-line"></rect>
				<circle cx="48" cy="176" r="13" fill="var(--ka-dg-bg)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line-strong)" stroke-width="1"></circle>
				<text x="48" y="180" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11">02</text>
				<text x="108" y="168" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11.5">DRAFT / 草案</text>
				<text x="108" y="193" class="dg-title dg-text" font-size="20">draft</text>
				<text x="572" y="193" text-anchor="end" class="dg-muted" font-size="14.5">把需求改写成可执行草案，允许之后推翻</text>
			</g>

			<!-- 03 plan -->
			<g>
				<rect x="88" y="224" width="500" height="64" rx="12" class="dg-surface dg-line"></rect>
				<circle cx="48" cy="256" r="13" fill="var(--ka-dg-bg)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line-strong)" stroke-width="1"></circle>
				<text x="48" y="260" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11">03</text>
				<text x="108" y="248" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11.5">PLAN / 策略</text>
				<text x="108" y="273" class="dg-title dg-text" font-size="20">plan</text>
				<text x="572" y="273" text-anchor="end" class="dg-muted" font-size="14.5">tile / dtype / 访存 / 融合：列出候选策略</text>
			</g>

			<!-- 04 候选 kernel -->
			<g>
				<rect x="88" y="304" width="500" height="64" rx="12" class="dg-surface dg-line"></rect>
				<circle cx="48" cy="336" r="13" fill="var(--ka-dg-bg)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line-strong)" stroke-width="1"></circle>
				<text x="48" y="340" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11">04</text>
				<text x="108" y="328" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11.5">CANDIDATE / 候选</text>
				<text x="108" y="353" class="dg-title dg-text" font-size="20">候选 kernel</text>
				<text x="572" y="353" text-anchor="end" class="dg-muted" font-size="14.5">多版本并存，每个版本都可复现</text>
			</g>

			<!-- 05 验证矩阵 -->
			<g>
				<rect x="88" y="384" width="500" height="112" rx="13" fill="var(--ka-dg-amber-soft)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-amber)" stroke-width="1.3"></rect>
				<circle cx="48" cy="440" r="13" fill="var(--ka-dg-amber-soft)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-amber)" stroke-width="1.2"></circle>
				<text x="48" y="444" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono dg-amber" font-size="11">05</text>
				<text x="108" y="408" class="dg-mono dg-amber" font-size="11.5">VERIFY MATRIX / 验证矩阵</text>
				<text x="108" y="436" class="dg-title dg-amber" font-size="20">验证矩阵</text>
				<text x="572" y="436" text-anchor="end" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="12">证据先于结论</text>

				<g>
					<rect x="108" y="450" width="110" height="28" rx="6" fill="var(--ka-dg-surface)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)" stroke-width="1"></rect>
					<text x="163" y="468" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text" font-size="13.5">编译</text>
				</g>
				<g>
					<rect x="226" y="450" width="110" height="28" rx="6" fill="var(--ka-dg-surface)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)" stroke-width="1"></rect>
					<text x="281" y="468" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-text" font-size="13.5">正确性</text>
				</g>
				<g>
					<rect x="344" y="450" width="124" height="28" rx="6" fill="var(--ka-dg-surface)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)" stroke-width="1"></rect>
					<text x="406" y="468" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono dg-text" font-size="12.5">benchmark</text>
				</g>
				<g>
					<rect x="476" y="450" width="92" height="28" rx="6" fill="var(--ka-dg-surface)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)" stroke-width="1"></rect>
					<text x="522" y="468" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono dg-text" font-size="12.5">ncu</text>
				</g>
			</g>

			<!-- 06 记录 -->
			<g>
				<rect x="88" y="512" width="500" height="64" rx="12" class="dg-surface dg-line"></rect>
				<circle cx="48" cy="544" r="13" fill="var(--ka-dg-bg)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line-strong)" stroke-width="1"></circle>
				<text x="48" y="548" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11">06</text>
				<text x="108" y="536" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11.5">RECORD / 记录</text>
				<text x="108" y="561" class="dg-title dg-text" font-size="20">记录</text>
				<text x="572" y="561" text-anchor="end" class="dg-muted" font-size="14.5">保留：理由与证据；放弃：失败模式</text>
			</g>

			<!-- 侧栏：可检索经验 -->
			<text x="624" y="70" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="11.5">知识供给 / SKILLS</text>

			<g>
				<rect x="624" y="90" width="308" height="196" rx="13" class="dg-surface dg-line"></rect>
				<text x="644" y="116" class="dg-mono dg-teal" font-size="11.5">SKILL / KERNELWIKI</text>
				<text x="644" y="148" class="dg-title dg-text" font-size="21">KernelWiki</text>
				<text x="644" y="172" class="dg-muted" font-size="14">可检索的算子与 PR 知识</text>
				<path d="M644 188H912" fill="none" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)" stroke-width="1"></path>
				<text x="644" y="213" class="dg-muted" font-size="13.5">· 仓库结构 / 历史 PR</text>
				<text x="644" y="236" class="dg-muted" font-size="13.5">· Hopper → Blackwell 约束</text>
				<text x="644" y="259" class="dg-muted" font-size="13.5">· 相似实现与失败模式</text>
				<text x="912" y="276" text-anchor="end" class="dg-mono dg-teal" font-size="11.5">供给 plan →</text>
			</g>

			<g>
				<rect x="624" y="316" width="308" height="184" rx="13" class="dg-surface dg-line"></rect>
				<text x="644" y="342" class="dg-mono dg-teal" font-size="11.5">SKILL / NCU-REPORT</text>
				<text x="644" y="374" class="dg-title dg-text" font-size="21">ncu-report</text>
				<text x="644" y="398" class="dg-muted" font-size="14">把六维分析固化成顺序</text>
				<path d="M644 414H912" fill="none" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)" stroke-width="1"></path>
				<text x="644" y="439" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="12.5">occupancy / launch</text>
				<text x="644" y="462" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="12.5">stall · tensor core</text>
				<text x="644" y="485" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="12.5">memory / cache</text>
				<text x="912" y="462" text-anchor="end" class="dg-mono dg-amber" font-size="11.5">供给验证 →</text>
			</g>

			<g>
				<rect x="624" y="516" width="308" height="60" rx="12" fill="var(--ka-dg-teal-soft)" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)"></rect>
				<text x="644" y="542" class="dg-title dg-teal" font-size="14">skill = 可检索、可引用的文件</text>
				<text x="644" y="562" class="dg-muted" font-size="12.5">不是 prompt 里的一句形容词</text>
			</g>

			<!-- 知识供给连接线 -->
			<g aria-hidden="true">
				<path d="M624 256H596" fill="none" stroke="var(--ka-dg-teal)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4" marker-end="url(#ka-kda-arrow-teal)"></path>
				<text x="610" y="249" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-teal" font-size="11.5">检索</text>
				<path d="M624 440H596" fill="none" stroke="var(--ka-dg-amber)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4" marker-end="url(#ka-kda-arrow-amber)"></path>
				<text x="610" y="433" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-amber" font-size="11.5">六维</text>
			</g>

			<!-- 底部：Coder / Verifier -->
			<g>
				<rect x="28" y="600" width="904" height="68" rx="13" class="dg-surface-2 dg-line-strong"></rect>
				<text x="48" y="626" class="dg-mono dg-teal" font-size="11.5">CODER / 实现</text>
				<text x="48" y="649" class="dg-mono dg-muted" font-size="13.5">inspect · edit · compile · test · profile · benchmark</text>
				<path d="M560 616V652" fill="none" stroke="var(--ka-dg-line)" stroke-width="1"></path>
				<text x="584" y="626" class="dg-mono dg-amber" font-size="11.5">VERIFIER / 复核</text>
				<text x="584" y="649" class="dg-muted" font-size="14">对照 acceptance criteria 复核证据</text>
			</g>
		</svg>
	</div>
</Figure>
